== Usage ==
This template is designed for use by {{tl|Taxobox/core}}.

{{tl2|Taxobox/species|''status system parameter''|''conservation status parameter''}}

Returns the conservation code coloured circles and adds categories.

;Examples
* <nowiki>{{Taxobox/species |IUCN2.3 |EX }}</nowiki>
* <nowiki>{{Taxobox/species |TNC |T5 }}</nowiki>

